    <!--
      Passable high-clutter forest for reactive optical-flow avoidance.
      Test region: x in [-14, 18] m, y in [-13, 12] m => 800 m^2.
      Obstacles: 80 => density 0.10 obstacles/m^2.
      Pole collision radius: 0.30 m, height: 3.0 m.
      Start/goal used when arranging the corridor: (-19,-3) -> (8,9.5).
      Background poles stay >= 2.6 m from the straight start-goal route.
      Five isolated challenge poles lie on the route, separated longitudinally,
      so the UAV must perform repeated local avoidance but is not boxed into traps.
      Background minimum centre spacing is approximately 2.15 m.
    -->
